  "stepCount": 4,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "title": "Tighten reply-box spacing",
      "body": "Cut the reply box top margin to **4px** and the thread-actions bar to **6px** margin + **6px** padding (verified the exact gaps in an isolated repro).",
      "paths": [
        "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/CommentAnnotation.svelte"
      ],
      "callouts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "title": "Add "View on GitHub" to the comment menu",
      "body": "The overflow (•••) menu now always renders and exposes **View on GitHub**, opening the comment's permalink via `window.api.shell.openExternal`. Delete moves behind a separator when deletable.",
      "paths": [
        "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/CommentAnnotation.svelte"
      ],
      "callouts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "title": "Stop the menu wrapping its text",
      "body": "The shared content sizes to the anchor (the tiny ••• button) floored at 128px, so "View on GitHub" wrapped. Fixed locally with `w-auto!` (important needed because tailwind-merge v2.6 doesn't merge the v4 `w-(...)` syntax). Verified in a faithful absolute-positioned repro: before 128px/2 lines, after ~145px/1 line.",
      "paths": [
        "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/CommentAnnotation.svelte"
      ],
      "callouts": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "title": "Reply prompt expands into the full editor",
      "body": "Mirrors GitHub: the reply affordance starts as a slim one-line prompt; clicking (or focusing) it swaps in the same **MarkdownComposer** (Write/Preview + toolbar) the new-comment composer uses, with **Cancel**/**Reply** actions. Cmd/Ctrl+Enter posts, Esc cancels, collapses + clears after a successful post.

Focus fix: Carta's `autoFocus` only fires on initial page load, so a dynamically-mounted editor (the expanded reply) never grabbed focus. MarkdownComposer now focuses its internal `<textarea>` imperatively on mount when `autofocus` is set — which also firms up the new-comment composer.",
      "paths": [
        "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/CommentAnnotation.svelte",
        "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/MarkdownComposer.svelte"
      ],
      "callouts": [
        {
          "id": "step-4-c1",
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/CommentAnnotation.svelte",
          "startLine": 247,
          "endLine": 296,
          "side": "new",
          "body": "Expanded branch reuses MarkdownComposer; collapsed branch is a readonly input that expands on focus/click."
        },
        {
          "id": "step-4-c2",
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/lib/components/MarkdownComposer.svelte",
          "startLine": 30,
          "endLine": 37,
          "side": "new",
          "body": "Imperative focus on the next frame (Carta renders the textarea during its own mount), replacing the unreliable autoFocus attribute for dynamically-mounted editors."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
